  "sangamTamil": "கருத்துணர்ந்து கற்றறிந்தார் கேண்மையெஞ் ஞான்றுங்\nகுருத்தின் கரும்புதின் ற்றறே - குருத்திற்கு\nஎதிர்செலத்தின் றன்ன தகைத்தரோ, என்றும்\nமதுர மிலாளர் தொடர்பு.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "Satisfying friendships. Intimacy with those who understand the real intention (of one's words), and who have acquired wisdom by learning, will at all times be like eating sweet cane from the tender shoots; but attachment to those who have no sweetness of disposition is like eating it in a direction opposite to the tender shoot (it grows harder and less sweet).",
